    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165030/extras/36aac6ef51b5513503f5c0239bb8ac7b.avif?t=1748901055\" width=600 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165030/extras/2cf2593cc097eea27d405ff4872aab17.avif?t=1748901055\" width=600 height=75 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frosty Enterprise is a game in which you can start your ice cream business. You start your journey in a floating town. Your objective is to make ice creams, milkshakes, sundaes and floats for the town's residents and to grow your business!</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165030/extras/1509c1b6151e15e0bbe2a2471c27ed2a.poster.avif?t=1748901055\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165030/extras/1509c1b6151e15e0bbe2a2471c27ed2a.webm?t=1748901055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165030/extras/1509c1b6151e15e0bbe2a2471c27ed2a.mp4?t=1748901055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165030/extras/b516606fdb0a4dffb5fc81b834bdb793.avif?t=1748901055\" width=600 height=75 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Adjust your business to your best strategy. Buy different product setups to unlock their sale. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Buy fruits, syrups and other ingredients to make ice cream.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Bring ingredients to discover and unlock different flavors.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Make more money by selling complex recipes that you can create in your ice cream lab.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Increase the level of your business to unlock more stuff about your truck.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165030/extras/a1d706da4b1681e5133c9d25b8452c75.poster.avif?t=1748901055\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165030/extras/a1d706da4b1681e5133c9d25b8452c75.webm?t=1748901055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165030/extras/a1d706da4b1681e5133c9d25b8452c75.mp4?t=1748901055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165030/extras/49e6da2eba06ceed8a1a3bc9825a8d7e.avif?t=1748901055\" data-has-big width=800 height=591 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 ENJOY!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the beautiful world of Frosty Enterprise. Your business is waiting for you!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165030/extras/36aac6ef51b5513503f5c0239bb8ac7b.avif?t=1748901055\" width=600 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165030/extras/2cf2593cc097eea27d405ff4872aab17.avif?t=1748901055\" width=600 height=75 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frosty Enterprise is a game in which you can start your ice cream business. You start your journey in a floating town. Your objective is to make ice creams, milkshakes, sundaes and floats for the town's residents and to grow your business!</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165030/extras/1509c1b6151e15e0bbe2a2471c27ed2a.poster.avif?t=1748901055\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165030/extras/1509c1b6151e15e0bbe2a2471c27ed2a.webm?t=1748901055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165030/extras/1509c1b6151e15e0bbe2a2471c27ed2a.mp4?t=1748901055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165030/extras/b516606fdb0a4dffb5fc81b834bdb793.avif?t=1748901055\" width=600 height=75 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Adjust your business to your best strategy. Buy different product setups to unlock their sale. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Buy fruits, syrups and other ingredients to make ice cream.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Bring ingredients to discover and unlock different flavors.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Make more money by selling complex recipes that you can create in your ice cream lab.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Increase the level of your business to unlock more stuff about your truck.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165030/extras/a1d706da4b1681e5133c9d25b8452c75.poster.avif?t=1748901055\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165030/extras/a1d706da4b1681e5133c9d25b8452c75.webm?t=1748901055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165030/extras/a1d706da4b1681e5133c9d25b8452c75.mp4?t=1748901055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165030/extras/49e6da2eba06ceed8a1a3bc9825a8d7e.avif?t=1748901055\" data-has-big width=800 height=591 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 ENJOY!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the beautiful world of Frosty Enterprise. Your business is waiting for you!</p>",
